MODULE: ConsumerBatchesRespondViewIgnoresThrottled
TARGET: ConsumerBatchesRespond
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the view ignores only the throttled batch response
PERTURBS: ViewShrinkBatch

--- FIND
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.view = ViewBatch(treeVerdict[1])]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: retain full size only for a Throttled physical source.
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.view = IF treeVerdict[1] = 1 THEN FullBatch ELSE ViewBatch(treeVerdict[1])]
--- END
